{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ASTROCOMPANY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend your Core in an endless low-poly galaxy. <br>Build towers, mine resources, draft cards, and fight against waves of asteroids, ships, and colossal bosses. <br>How long can you survive?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042610/extras/19a5c4add8c641a3a3931a527df440be.avif?t=1760019091\" width=1536 height=90 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no panic-building here. You can only construct during the short breaks between enemy assaults. <br>Every Processing Unit, every Miner, every tower placement matters. <br>Some towers even take several waves to finish \u2014 commit early and hope to live long enough to see them complete.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042610/extras/121d9599ea345fd939fb5778943b884a.avif?t=1760019091\" width=1536 height=90 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a few waves, fate offers you a choice. <br>Pick one of several random cards: new projectiles, mining boosts, Core upgrades\u2026 <br>Sometimes you will even find <strong>legendary cards</strong>, powerful enough to completely transform a tower into something new.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042610/extras/ecd75df6f3da8ddd3e7eead32f28a74b.poster.avif?t=1760019091\" width=800 height=466 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042610/extras/ecd75df6f3da8ddd3e7eead32f28a74b.webm?t=1760019091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042610/extras/ecd75df6f3da8ddd3e7eead32f28a74b.mp4?t=1760019091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042610/extras/b4a3e393ede52337c88ac7874f6f9c18.avif?t=1760019091\" width=1536 height=90 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scrap, Iron, and Crystal fuel your survival. <br>Place Miners on asteroids to gather resources, but every Miner means one less turret. <br>Do you invest in economy now, or in firepower to survive the next wave?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042610/extras/d388c1625f81f4d9c70c89923570de43.avif?t=1760019091\" width=1536 height=90 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From drifting asteroids to armed ships and terrifying bosses \u2014 every wave grows harder. <br>Some enemies shoot back, some spawn reinforcements, others demand entirely new tactics. <br>By wave 30 or 40, only the best-planned defenses can survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042610/extras/ba4f320675763df48593951978614d46.poster.avif?t=1760019091\" width=800 height=466 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042610/extras/ba4f320675763df48593951978614d46.webm?t=1760019091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042610/extras/ba4f320675763df48593951978614d46.mp4?t=1760019091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042610/extras/15fb11f64118a75386080f406f46d020.avif?t=1760019091\" width=1536 height=90 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run earns you more than just a score.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new towers with unique roles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover common, rare, and legendary cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with extra resources or Processing Units</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain permanent meta-upgrades to push further each time</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042610/extras/92856e51b8660f62ba596319e804d6f3.avif?t=1760019091\" width=1536 height=90 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless tower defense survival in stylized low-poly space</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player-controlled Core that can fight and upgrade</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelike card drafts without deckbuilding overhead</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mining economy and AI Core system for strategic depth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escalating waves: asteroids, ships, elites, bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Permanent progression and leaderboards</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HOW FAR WILL YOU GO?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the fragile first tower at wave 1, <br>to the chaos of wave 40 and beyond \u2014 <br>every decision shapes your survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist <strong>ASTROCOMPANY</strong> now and join the endless defense.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4042610?t=1760019091","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042610/160a4e85bf681cc0056b42cf5433eb6a5e3c837b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760019091","capsule_ima